        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global ED-VR531-AL Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSurface mounted vertical rod touch bar exit device is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 (Highest Grade) Touch Bar Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty industrial  and commercial doors. For use on single or double door applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese vertical rod exit devices are <b>non-handed for doors 26\" to 36\" wide</b>. The latches, springs and (2) guides are made from long lasting high strength stainless steel. These exit devices are listed by U.L./U.L.C. and comply with U.L. 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Global ED-ED531-AL Exit Device:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Powder Coated Steel push bar, stainless steel springs</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>Latch: Top pullman type, Bottom bolt assembly</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Rods: 1/2\" OD round tubing.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" Will cover 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Top - surface mounted rim type, Bottom - flat round mortise or into threshold</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile: 3\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Reversible, non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 36\", Field sizable to 26\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Height: 7' standard. Add <a href=\"/products/1-foot-vertical-rod-extension-glo-ed-rod12\"><b>ED-ROD12 1 Foot Extension</b></a> for 8' doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 40\" from finished floor to center line of push rail</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal and machine screws</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: 1/2\" of a turn 7/32\" hex key</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed: 12PJ SA 32524</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Fire Rating: Available Option</li> -->\r\n<li>ANSI A156.3 Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 1 Year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device, Global ED-VR531-AL",
                "description": "Global ED-VR531-AL Surface mounted vertical rod touch bar exit device is for use on hollow metal or wood doors where there is no projection on the door face. A Grade 1 (Highest Grade) Touch Bar Exit Device, sutiable for heavy duty industrial  and commercial doors. For use on single or double door applications. ",
